/* Every setting's name as the menu and the console show it, one
 * NAME(id, "...") each in setting_id_t's order. Plain printable ASCII, no
 * escapes, at most 23 characters. Kept in flash, byte-pair coded
 * (tools/gen_help_text.py writes Core/Src/ui_names_packed.inc; validate_current.py
 * checks they agree): the radio needs its names with or without a card. */

